cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "vtamR: Validation and Taxonomic Assignment of Metabarcoding Data with R"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/meglecz/vtamR"
url: "https://meglecz.github.io/vtamR/"
abstract: >-
  A rewrite and extension in R of VTAM (Gonzalez et al. 2023). vtamR enables
  modular, control-calibrated validation of metabarcoding occurrences and
  supports reproducible biodiversity assessment and long-term monitoring.
keywords:
  - metabarcoding
  - eDNA
  - taxonomic assignment
  - R package
authors:
